            "review_title": "Review at Pranaam Bharat Restaurant-Ho Chi Minh",
            "review_text": "SophiaLoreen\nOslo, Norway423 contributions\n0\nCozy neighborhood restaurant with good food\nApr 2025 • Solo\nPranaam Bharat is a cosy \"local\" restaurant, with a few tables. I ordered Butter Chicken, which was a good choice. The chicken was tender and very tasty, the sauce creamy. I also ordered a freshly pressed mango juice without sugar, it tasted very fresh and I am happy to find non alcoholic options that are sugar free. I didnt ask for a bottle of water, but it was put on my table and costed me 15.000 VND. Not a big deal, but worth mentioning.\nRead more\nWritten April 23, 2025",
